    "Name": "Night Hawk",
    "Details": "A fast reaction mech designed to hunt down enemy scouts and raiding units, the 35 ton Night Hawk was developed by Mountain Wolf Battlemechs in 2656. Built around a 210-rated XL Engine, the Night Hawk NTK-2Q-EC was an early Clan upgrade from the dawn of the Golden Century. Armed with an ER Large Laser and a Large Laser, a prototype ER Medium Laser provides additional firepower should enemies close in.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.98</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
